  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "On the Hairy Foot Mountain battlefield, a sharp phoenix chirp pierces eardrums and runs through the fight. The source is Prince Feng Xian’s killer move Phoenix Chirping Divine Flame. The flames burn with raging intensity, coil around Di Zang Sheng, and set that body ablaze. Bai Cang Shui also sends water waves at the same target, and other Heavenly Court immortals strike with lightning and poison, each taking an area of the huge body. Di Zang Sheng still rushes the nine-nine consecutive unceasing formation.",
